        <activityName xml:lang="en">Disposal, ash poultry litter pellets, to landfarming</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Disposal, ash poultry litter pellets, to landfarming
Ash composition data completed with the inventory of disposal, wood ash mixture, pure, 0% water, to landfarming;
UUID: df31bd6f-84f0-4cb6-bea0-c6d0f5165e16
This data set includes emissions to agricultural soil due to the land farming of ash
Location: The inventory is modelled for a pilot plant in Switzerland
Technology: grate furnace 300kW
Time period: Collection of data and publication.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_df31bd6f-84f0-4cb6-bea0-c6d0f5165e16.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
